  "details": "I don't have video footage of this bug yet, and I'm unsure exactly how to repro the bug. However, there is a bug that will mess with the viewport of a desktop user after crouching then walking. It seems to be a bit of a rare occurrence, as I've seen it on two separate occasions. First time happening to me, another time happening to someone else.\n\nThe criteria seems to be along the lines of:\n\n1. Be in desktop mode\n\n2. Press C to crouch, and start walking while crouched.\n\n3. Observe that the viewport does not line up with expected results.\n\nIt was also observed that the bug can be patched by switching avatars and then trying to crouch walk again. I remember that it happened in The Great Pug, but I'll provide updates and an avatar ID if it happens to me again.",
